{"id":"c4ad19a65f2d8802","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-fibre-global.md","title":"prop-fibrewise-to-total-products","display":"prop-fibrewise-to-total-products","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-prop-fibre-global","aliases":["16-prop-fibre-global","16-pro--fibre-global"],"display":"prop-fibrewise-to-total-products","depends_on":["[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]"],"source":"Proposition 9.2.1, pp. 520–521 (PDF 540–541)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-fibre-global"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-fibre-global</span><span>16-pro--fibre-global</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-fibrewise-to-total-products"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 9.2.1, pp. 520–521 (PDF 540–541)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 为该指定分裂诱导的重索引。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>；其源靶范畴均取当前函子的已声明类型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>取基底终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 上的纤维终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>。任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 经沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pX\\to1\">\\(pX\\to1\\)</span> 的笛卡尔分解和纤维终性唯一映入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>，所以它是总范畴终对象。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E_I,Y\\in\\mathcal E_J\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E_I,Y\\in\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>，在基底积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times J\">\\(I\\times J\\)</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\pi_1^*X\\times\\pi_2^*Y\">\\(P=\\pi_1^*X\\times\\pi_2^*Y\\)</span>，投影后接两条笛卡尔提升得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\to X,Y\">\\(P\\to X,Y\\)</span>。给定任意总锥，先以基积唯一确定基箭头，再以笛卡尔分解和重索引保积确定唯一垂直介体。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是总范畴积；其基底投影正是已选积投影，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 保有限积。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Proposition 9.2.1, pp. 520–521（PDF 540–541）中的总范畴积构造；本页给出有限积特例的完整论证。分裂是本页的既有假设，实际构造仅需要 cleavage。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","status":"resolved","id":"8b663a0efd45aead","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947